      "description": "Glitch\u00b2-style XY pad for NTS-3. Keeps a tempo-synced AUDIO IN buffer (get_raw_input on firmware 1.4+) and plays Illformed-style scenes from the pad. Untouched = bypass. Hold to glitch. X = scene (RTRG, REV, SHUF, TAPE, STRCH, GATE, CRUSH, DLY), Y = slice / rate (1/2 to 1/64), Depth = wet. DECAY fades repeats / tape / delay feedback. CRUSH stacks lo-fi. SYNC: EVEN, TRIP, DOT, FREE. HOLD: GATE or LATCH.",
